 r←Test_TableEdit_013(stopFlag batchFlag);parms;n;⎕TRAP;table;rowTitles
⍝ Press <enter> in the last row. Adds two rows with specific contents thanks to the "rowPrototype" function.
⍝ See also Test_TableEdit_007 and Test_TableEdit_012.
 r←∆Inactive
 :Return

 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

⍝⍝⍝ Preconditions
 #.⎕SHADOW'TEMP'
 'TEMP'#.⎕NS''
 #.TEMP.RowPrototype←{
     n←⍵
     'Row:'(1+↑⍴n.Grid.Values)
 }

 table←⍉⊃('Obama' 'Bush' 'Clinton' 'Reagan' 'Kennedy' 'Carter')(1 0 1 0 1 1)
 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Table.CreateParms
 parms.posn←35 25
 parms.size←400 600
 parms.colTitles←'Name' 'Democrat'
 parms.addToCaption←'Testing Table.Run'
 parms.confirmQuit←0
 parms.testMode←1
 parms.rowPrototype←'#.TEMP.RowPrototype'

 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Table.Create table #.APLGUI.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults parms

 n.Grid.CurCell←⍴n.Grid.Values
 n.Grid ∆KeyPress⊂'ER'
 0.5 ∆Process n.∆Form
 n.Grid ∆KeyPress⊂'ER'
 0.5 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →GoToTidyUp(⍴n.Grid.Values)≢2 0+⍴table
 →GoToTidyUp n.Grid.Values[¯1 0+¯1+↑⍴n.Grid.Values;]≢2 2⍴'Row:' 7 'Row:' 8

 r←∆OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
